  "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef positional_encoding(seq_len: int, d_model: int, base: float = 10000.0) -> np.ndarray:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns a NumPy array of shape (seq_len, d_model).\n    \"\"\"\n    # Write code here\n    pass",
